Package: freerdp3-clipboard
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: catcursor <noreply@github.com>
Depends: libc6, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libavcodec61 | libavcodec60, libavformat61 | libavformat60, libavutil59 | libavutil58, libcairo2, libcups2 | libcups2t64, libfido2-1, libfuse3-4 | libfuse3-3, libgsm1, libkrb5-3, libopus0, libpcsclite1, libpulse0, libsoxr0, libssl3 | libssl3t64, libswresample5 | libswresample4, libswscale8 | libswscale7, libsystemd0, libudev1, liburiparser1, libusb-1.0-0, libv4l-0, libwebp7, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbfile1, libxrandr2, libxrender1, libxtst6, libxv1, zlib1g
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/catcursor/FreeRDP
Description: Isolated FreeRDP 3 X11 client with explicit clipboard push hotkey
 Installs under /opt/freerdp-clipboard and provides xfreerdp3-clipboard.
 Win/Super+Shift+V explicitly sends and pastes non-file host clipboard data in
 the active RDP session while normal local-to-remote transfer remains disabled.
